      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Played a game last night against Baron Blade and had two questions come up. &nbsp;</p><p>First, does Twist the Ether stay in play after a villain flips or is it destroyed? &nbsp;</p><p>Second, the player wanted to play Mental Divergence against Paparazzi On the Scene from the Megalopolis environment. &nbsp;Twist the Ether says destroy one ongoing card but the Paparazzi card doesn&#39;t have the ongoing keyword. &nbsp;Is it a viable target?</p><p>My reasoning was that it had to have the keyword. &nbsp;They argued that although it doesn&#39;t have the ongoing keyword, the effects of the card were still ongoing until the card was destroyed. &nbsp;Wasn&#39;t that big an issue, was just looking for some clarification. &nbsp;Thanks.</p>",
