      "raw": "<p>Although Baron Blade has different HP on both sides, he remains the same target. The same applies to any other target, TtE is only destroyed if the target it is attached to is destroyed or discarded and flipping a target is not the same as destroying it.</p><p>You were right to surmise that the ongoing keyword is needed for a card to be an ongoing card, the Paparazzi is an environment card, not an ongoing. At present there are no environment cards which are also have the keyword ongoing.</p>",
