      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/58f4c7/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-02-28T18:12:47.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Twist the Ether only goes to the trash if the target leaves play. The only&nbsp;character cards that leave play&nbsp;when they are destroyed (without ending the game) are the Chairman and Omnitron. All other character cards will end the game or flip (and stay in play)&nbsp;when they are destroyed. Cards like Twist the Ether or Infection stay in play if their target flips.</p>",
      "post_number": 3,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:27:42.371Z",
